EC6: < ev:3 , h:2 , w:1 > 
EC6: Example01_Basic_Timed_System_S:q1
note left of EC6
$time = $delay_1
	$delay = $delay_1
	
end note
EC6: ----
EC6: tpid#1->q0.tr1

EC6 -down-> EC7

state "EC 10" as EC10 << PassedPath >>

EC10: < ev:3 , h:2 , w:1 > 
EC10: Example01_Basic_Timed_System_S:q1
note left of EC10
$time = $delay_1
	$delay = $delay_1
	
