EC14 -down-> EC15

state "EC 3" as EC3 << PassedPath >>

EC3: < ev:0 , h:3 , w:1 > 
EC3: Example01_Basic_Timed_System_S:q0
note left of EC3
PC: ($delay_2 <= 5)
	$time = ($delay_1 + $delay_2)
	$delay = $delay_2
	cl = $delay_2
	
end note
EC3: ----
EC3: tpid#2->q1.tr2

state "EC 17" as EC17 << DefaultNode >>

EC17: < ev:0 , h:3 , w:1 > 
EC17: Example01_Basic_Timed_System_S:q1
note left of EC17
PC: exists< # : urational >(($delay_2 < #) && (# <= 5))
	$time = ($delay_1 + $delay_2)
	$delay = $delay_2
	
end note
EC17: ----
EC17: QUIESCENCE

