	$delay = $delay_2
	cl = $delay_2
	
end note
EC11: ----
EC11: tpid#2->q1.tr2

state "EC 15" as EC15 << PassedPath >>

EC15: < ev:0 , h:3 , w:1 > 
EC15: Example01_Basic_Timed_System_S:q0
note left of EC15
PC: ($delay_2 <= 5)
	$time = ($delay_1 + $delay_2)
	$delay = $delay_2
	cl = $delay_2
	
end note
EC15: ----
EC15: tpid#2->q1.tr2
@enduml